   "name": "Dante Trader Jr.",
   "pos": "S",
   "status": "Active",
   "date": "2026-10-10T00:11Z",
   "shortComment": "Trader (shin) does not have an injury designation against the Bengals on Sunday, Paul Dehner Jr. of The Athletic reports.",
   "longComment": "Trader opened Week 5 prep with consecutive limited practices, but he avoided an injury tag after logging a full session Friday. The second-year safety has 19 tackles (nine solo) and two pass defenses (one interception) through the first four games of the regular season.",
   "details": null
  },
  {
   "id": "641594",
   "name": "Chris Bell",
   "pos": "WR",
   "status": "Active",
   "date": "2026-10-09T21:19Z",
   "shortComment": "Bell (knee) does not have an injury designation for Sunday's game against the Bengals, Paul Dehner Jr. of The Athletic reports.",
   "longComment": "Bell has played through a knee issue over the Dolphins' last couple of games, and the rookie third-rounder will do so again Sunday after logging a full practice Friday. He was unable to haul in any of his three targets during Miami's Week 4 loss to Minnesota, but he could see more looks from QB Malik Willis this weekend due to the continued absence of fellow rookie Caleb Douglas (ankle).",
